{"id":"bd9e76e12467ad85","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal Sum Step","display":"df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step — ZFC Ordinal Sum Step","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step — ZFC Ordinal Sum Step","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal-sum-step — ZFC Ordinal Sum Step"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c69d32e1f9abdeeb\" href=\"?note=c69d32e1f9abdeeb\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md\">../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdAdd}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdAdd}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c69d32e1f9abdeeb\" href=\"?note=c69d32e1f9abdeeb\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md\">../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalSumStep}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalSumStep}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}sum\\text{-}step} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdinalSumStep}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\n\\gamma=\\operatorname{OrdAdd}(\\alpha,\\beta+1)\\land\n\\gamma=\\operatorname{OrdAdd}(\\alpha,\\beta)+1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}sum\\text{-}step} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdinalSumStep}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\n\\gamma=\\operatorname{OrdAdd}(\\alpha,\\beta+1)\\land\n\\gamma=\\operatorname{OrdAdd}(\\alpha,\\beta)+1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The third argument is the successor-stage result; the former two-place predicate merely restated an identity true for every pair of ordinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md","status":"resolved","id":"c69d32e1f9abdeeb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-ordadd.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","